<title>MALAYSIA: SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-DUNHILL CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the eight-nation</p>
<p>Dunhill Cup soccer tournament match on Sunday:</p>
<p> China     2	 Finland    1  (halftime 1-0)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>China - Li Ming 16, Hao Hai Dong 55</p>
<p>Finland - Su Mao Zhen 53 o.g.</p>
<p> Malaysia  0	 Singapore  0</p>
